{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib"]]},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/glib\/dgettext(domain:msgid:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This function is a wrapper of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dgettext()"},{"text":" which does not translate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the message if the default domain as set with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"textdomain()"},{"text":" has no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"translations for the current locale."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dgettext"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"domain"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"UnsafePointer","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SP"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@gchar","text":"gchar","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"msgid"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"UnsafePointer","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SP"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"gchar","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@gchar"},{"text":">!) -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"!","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The advantage of using this function over "},{"code":"dgettext()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" proper is that","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"libraries using this function (like GTK) will not use translations","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"if the application using the library does not have translations for"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the current locale.  This results in a consistent English-only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"interface instead of one having partial translations.  For this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"feature to work, the call to "},{"code":"textdomain()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"setlocale()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" should","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"precede any ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"g_dgettext()"},{"type":"text","text":" invocations.  For GTK, it means calling"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"textdomain()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before gtk_init or its variants.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This function disables translations if and only if upon its first"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"call all the following conditions hold:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"domain","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is not "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"textdomain()"},{"type":"text","text":" has been called to set a default text domain"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"there is no translations available for the default text domain","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"and the current locale","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"current locale is not “C” or any English locales (those","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"starting with “en_”)","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Note that this behavior may not be desired for example if an application","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"has its untranslated messages in a language other than English. In those","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"cases the application should call ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"textdomain()"},{"type":"text","text":" after initializing GTK."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Applications should normally not use this function directly,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"but use the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"_()"},{"text":" macro for translations.","type":"text"}]}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"GLib"}],"title":"dgettext(domain:msgid:)","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Function","externalID":"s:4GLib8dgettext6domain5msgidSSSgSPys4Int8VGSg_AItF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dgettext","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"domain"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"UnsafePointer","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SP"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"text":"gchar","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@gchar"},{"kind":"text","text":">?, "},{"text":"msgid","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UnsafePointer"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"text":"gchar","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@gchar"},{"text":">!) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"!","kind":"text"}],"symbolKind":"func"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/dgettext(domain:msgid:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/dgettext(domain:msgid:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"This function is a wrapper of ","type":"text"},{"code":"dgettext()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" which does not translate"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the message if the defau